findings.citation_text:
6-501.12 Floors were observed to be soiled with debris and general buildup in the following areas:
1) walk-in cooler under shelving;
2) under reach-in cooler in prep area;
3) under counter holding oven in prep area;
4) under handwashing sink in prep area;
5) under metal table in prep area next to handwashing sink;
6) under wire shelving used for storage of fryer oil and bulk potatoes; and
7) under handwashing sink and 3 part sink.
Ensure cleaning under equipment occurs as needed to eliminate buildup.
Physical facilities shall be cleaned as often as necessary to keep them clean.
